The data in oncoj/ and docs/ are adapted from the Oxford-NINJAL Corpus of Old Japanese (ONCOJ), whose corpus
annotation is licensed under CC BY 4.0: Frellesvig, Bjarke, Stephen Wright Horn et al. (eds.) 2021 (oncoj/, release
2021.12) and 2026 (docs/, working data as of 2026-11-18). Oxford-NINJAL Corpus of Old Japanese. http://oncoj.ninjal.ac.jp/. The changes made are listed in oncoj/README.md and docs/README.md (search interface in docs/).
